  "statement": {
    "en": "Fine-step stock evolution under coarse Pace rule cadences satisfies intra-span block slack bounds, yields feasibility when initial buffer covers the Pace identification lag (2N - 1) plus safe-headroom, and proves unrecoverable collapse when initial margin falls short."
  },
